as then that","h":0.010174418290456178},{"h":0.011734496355056745,"w":0.25490194320678711,"x":0.047930296261530073,"text":"they realised they had forgotten their","y":0.89534883712164404},{"text":"umbrellas.","y":0.90829752904894845,"h":0.0089863371849059348,"x":0.047893428251007251,"w":0.069790487289428715},{"y":0.37624999997290376,"x":0.3464052373759815,"text":"1 He asked me if\/whether I had seen the","w":0.27886709213256833,"h":0.0089244182904560931},{"x":0.35947712692650358,"h":0.011792635520299299,"y":0.38791666675970382,"text":"film the day before\/the previous day.","w":0.25272331237792967},{"y":0.39958333316981587,"w":0.27886709213256833,"text":"2 He asked me how my grandmother was.","x":0.34640523078556773,"h":0.013333333333333308},{"w":0.241830062866211,"h":0.010174418290456066,"x":0.3464052260469237,"text":"3 He asked her what her name was.","y":0.41279069766194254},{"y":0.42583333342834406,"w":0.27886709213256833,"h":0.01041666666666663,"text":"4 She asked me where I had found the key.","x":0.34640523667881384},{"h":0.011666666666666714,"x":0.34640523824180308,"y":0.43749999996079136,"w":0.28104574203491212,"text":"5 l asked her if she was writing a new book."},{"y":0.44853096883939569,"h":0.014235458374023402,"text":"6 The teacher told us to stop talking.","w":0.25095249176025397,"x":0.34620172327971038},{"h":0.01041666666666663,"text":"7 The boss told us not to eat at our desks.","y":0.46208333321351336,"w":0.27886709213256833,"x":0.3464052373759815},{"text":"Exercise 3","w":0.074436626434326136,"h":0.011418900887171346,"x":0.33097340883792742,"y":0.47902892134434483},{"h":0.010203488270441707,"text":"1 The woman added that John would","x":0.34640522982009303,"w":0.25708061218261713,"y":0.49124999988399176},{"text":"have to tell her the whole story once","w":0.25054466247558593,"h":0.011821705500284829,"x":0.35947712625131367,"y":0.50416666672884625},{"h":0.013333333333333308,"x":0.34640523823205882,"y":0.527500000159698,"text":"2 The girl said the ch